OL,3,C'Significant' fire at Borders primary
OL,4,Cschool
OL,6,FFirefighters tackled a blaze at a
OL,7,FBorders primary school on the
OL,8,Fafternoon of Saturday 25 July 2026.
OL,10,FThe Scottish Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,Fbelieves the fire at Newtown St
OL,12,FBoswells Primary School started
OL,13,Fexternally and then and moved to the
OL,14,Fbuilding.
OL,16,FA spokesperson for the service said,
OL,17,F"We got the first call at 1.37pm and
OL,18,Fwe had four pumps there. There were no
OL,19,Freported casualties. It was a fire
OL,20,Fthat involved the building."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/3
