OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1785325678
OL,3,C'Significant' fire at Borders primary
OL,4,Cschool
OL,6,FThey confirmed it was a 'significant'
OL,7,Fincident as four fire engines were
OL,8,Fneeded but it is too early to know the
OL,9,Flevel of damage.
OL,11,FScottish Borders Council confirmed the
OL,12,Ffire and said they have been working
OL,13,Fclosely with the emergency services to
OL,14,Fassess the situation.
OL,16,FA spokesperson continued, "Further
OL,17,Fupdates will be provided as
OL,18,Finformation becomes available."
